{
  "uid": "fn-sort_desc",
  "title": "sort_desc() — ordenar pelo valor (decrescente): o \"Top N\"",
  "tags": [
    "promql-lab",
    "09-labels-e-ordena-o"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "sort_desc() — ordenar pelo valor (decrescente): o \"Top N\"",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Analogia:** é a **tabela do campeonato**: quem tem mais pontos aparece em cima. `sort_desc(v)` ordena do **maior para o menor valor**; não muda valores nem labels.\n\n⚠️ Só faz efeito em **consultas instantâneas** (tabela, bar gauge). Em gráficos é ignorado. **NaN vai para o fim** (não para o topo).\nMétricas: `sort_desc_container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace,pod}` (imita cAdvisor; o 1º lugar muda com o tempo) e `sort_desc_http_requests_total{service,code}`.\n\n📘 Guia completo: `functions/sort_desc/README.md`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "🟢 1. CPU por pod ao longo do tempo (api-7f9c-a e api-7f9c-b disputam o topo)",
      "description": "rate() do counter de CPU = cores em uso.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(sort_desc_container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "🟢 2. sort_desc(): ranking completo, quem mais consome primeiro",
      "description": "Tabela 'Top pods por CPU' (cores). A 1ª linha é o pod mais alto NESTE instante; compare com o gráfico.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "env": true,
              "job": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(Time|job|instance|env|__name__)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(sort_desc_container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "🔴 3. Top 3: sort_desc(topk(3, ...))",
      "description": "topk escolhe QUAIS 3; sort_desc garante a ORDEM (topk sozinho não promete ordem).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-BlYlRd"
          },
          "custom": {},
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sort_desc(topk(3, sum by (pod) (rate(sort_desc_container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[1m]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "🟡 4. Taxa de erro por serviço: NaN vai para o FIM",
      "description": "payments 12% → checkout 5% → cart 1% → recommendations NaN (0 req/s = 0/0). O NaN NÃO sobe para o topo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
